mages": [{"image": "engenn6le02ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le02ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "About the author</p>Sally Davis is a recent addition to our team at Cambridge Life. Sally is a young woman with a natural talent for writing.  She was born in Cambridge in 1990 and attended the local high school. From an early age, she was inquisitive, outgoing and enthusiastic about facing life's challenges head on.  She excelled in the Creative Arts, was a member of the debate team and sat on the student council.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le02ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "At college, she studied communications and started a blog that described her travels, her interest in food and learning about other cultures. This online blog provided the opportunity to express her ideas and views about the world. She also enjoyed receiving feedback and ideas from her followers.  This sparked a career move into the magazine industry as a freelancer.", "time": "27100"}, {"image": "engenn6le02ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "She plans to hone her writing skills and provide our readers with a fresh, new way of seeing the world. A yoga enthusiast, Sally enjoys spending time with friends and her cat Meenee, and exploring this beautiful city.  If you would like to contact Sally, please email her your thoughts and ideas at SallyD@CambridgeLife.com.", "time": "50000"}], "coverimg": "engenn6le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": "engenn6le02ob08re4aud01", "type": "audio"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "title": ""}, {"id": 3, "contents": [{"value": "engenn6le02ob08re6aud01", "type": "audio"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "title": ""}, {"id": 4, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=